ancies', 'binding/integrity diagnostics', 'operational witnesses'"],"finding":"The Context enumerates seven observables (field-diff, orphaned bindings, unbound counts, summary tallies, text formatting, exit behavior, persisted report) but AC2 explicitly names owners only for field-diff (preview), binding/integrity (fsck), and operational witnesses (status). Summary tallies, text formatting, and exit behavior are not explicitly mapped to a named owner, leaving that assignment to executor judgment.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f8a34da539d8de95f","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context/Problem vs Acceptance Criteria line 2","norm_id":"n3783da5daa09dbeb","priority":0.4188,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor must decide whether summary tallies belong to status or fsck, and where formatting/exit parity lives, without a plan-stated default."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a sentence mapping tallies/formatting/exit to their intended owners, e.g. 'summary tallies and exit behavior route to status; per-owner text formatting follows each owner's existing result contract.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibili